From: Pranav Reddy <reddy.pranav89@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Jan 2023 16:34:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] power: oplus_charger: Fix slow charge while screen is on

Thanks to dodyirawan85

Change-Id: I05c69921e836436365a4965b679bb752c56dd631
---
 drivers/power/oplus/oplus_charger.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/power/oplus/oplus_charger.c b/drivers/power/oplus/oplus_charger.c
index 8c478852ded1d..94f00ce448f5b 100644
--- a/drivers/power/oplus/oplus_charger.c
+++ b/drivers/power/oplus/oplus_charger.c
@@ -4710,7 +4710,7 @@ static int fb_notifier_callback(struct notifier_block *nb,
 		if (event == FB_EVENT_BLANK) {
 			blank = *(int *)evdata->data;
 			if (blank == FB_BLANK_UNBLANK) {
-				g_charger_chip->led_on = true;
+				g_charger_chip->led_on = false;
 				g_charger_chip->led_on_change = true;
 			} else if (blank == FB_BLANK_POWERDOWN) {
 				g_charger_chip->led_on = false;
